                <note rend="inline" type="source">865.6363/3–345: Telegram</note>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">The Acting Secretary of State to the Ambassador in
                        Italy</hi> (<hi rendition="#italic">Kirk</hi>)</head>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">Washington</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1945-03-09T17:00:00-04:00">March 9, 1945—5
                            p.m.</date>
                    </dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>474. Reurtel 590, March 3, 10 a.m. Department concurs that note be presented
                    after publication of decree.</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">Grew</hi>
                    </signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
